 ("Gastrin increases acid secretion mainly by acting on:",["ECL cells to release histamine","Chief cells to release pepsinogen","D cells to release somatostatin","Mucous cells to release HCO₃⁻"],0,"Gastrin's main effect is via ECL histamine rather than a direct parietal cell action."),
